# An ALLOWLIST (M6, handoff 053). The build context starts empty and only what
# the app needs at runtime is added back, so private data that lives in this
# checkout (party_data, campaigns, users.json, invites.json, vault data,
# uploads, PDFs, dnd5e_data, .env, venvs) can never reach an image by being
# forgotten in a blocklist. Add a path here only if the running app reads it.
*
**

!app.py
!class_matrix.py
!pf2e_generator.py
!pf2e_database.db
!alembic.ini
!requirements.txt
!core/
!core/**
